OL,3,GDumfries, Galloway, Lothian & Borders
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FStaying
OL,6,Fmostly dry in the east but showers in
OL,7,Fthe west, which may be heavy. Variable
OL,8,Fcloud with clear spells, especially in
OL,9,Fthe east, leading to a chilly night
OL,10,Fhere.
OL,11,
OL,12,CFriday:FBright or sunny spells through
OL,13,Fthe day with scattered showers in the
OL,14,Fmorning, these mainly in the west.
OL,15,FShowers easing through the afternoon
OL,16,Fleading to dry conditions in the
OL,17,Fevening.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
