OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FDry
OL,6,Fand settled over the weekend with some
OL,7,Flong spells of sunshine on offer.
OL,8,FChillier nights than of late with
OL,9,Ffrost in places. Cloudier on Monday
OL,10,Fwith patchy rain possible.
